# A ripe bed picked near her: she takes it home, and the chimney puffs with her cooking.
set unlock all
set season summer
set clock day
place cottage @32,30 0
place planter @30,32 0
set grow 2000
set camera 31 31 2
wait 30
click @30,32
expect harvests 1
fast 50 event smoke yes
shot shots/harvest_carry.png
quit
